5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m a bit nervous about the ground here. Has anyone checked if the soil is stable enough for digging?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"Cute question, Minato. I’m more worried about the price tag after the ribbon is cut. Who’s paying for the upkeep?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I’d like to see how the last decade’s projects are holding up. Drawings look lovely, but I care about what remains.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I’m curious who will actually maintain this place day to day. The staffing rota seems to be shrinking every year.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m less interested in the soil and more in how people actually use the space. Let’s look at the real traffic patterns before we guess.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, I hear you, but if the ground shifts, the costs will be even higher. Can we check the soil stability first?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, soil is just one line item. I need to see the upkeep ledger to know if we can actually afford to keep this place alive.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, the ledger tells us the cost, but the condition of the earlier works tells us if the money was well spent.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, I agree. But knowing the condition doesn’t tell me who is left to fix it. I need to see the current staffing levels.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, staffing is a symptom, not the cause. I need the timed counts to see how people actually move through the space.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, I understand the traffic, but I’m still worried about the diggers. Can we check the firms tendering for earth-moving?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, the firms are just the symptom. I need the upkeep ledger to see the real long-term cost.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@May, the ledger shows the bill, but the condition of the earlier works shows if we’re wasting it. I’ll check that.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, fair point. But I still need to know who is left to do the work. I’ll look into the groundskeeping roll.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the roll tells me who’s left, but the counts tell me what they’re actually maintaining. I’ll take the timed crossings.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, I’ll check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving. I need to know if the ground will hold before we commit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
