37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: I’ve seen the condition of the earlier works. The basin held, but the apron failed. We must learn from that.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,- **Victoria**: The roll is down to seven. We’re buying in the specialists now. Who is left to actually show up on a Tuesday?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
