40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: @Shizue, that apron failure worries me. I found only two firms left for digging, and they both flagged the clay.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, that clay risk is exactly why I need the ledger. If the ground fails, the upkeep bill triples. I’ve seen the numbers.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""May"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**May**: @Minato, that clay risk is exactly why I need the ledger. If the ground fails, the upkeep bill triples. I’ve seen the numbers.""}]}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @May, the ledger shows the cost, but the apron shows the failure. We must not repeat that mistake.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @May, the ledger shows the bill, but my roll shows the hands. With only seven staff, who actually pays it?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the roll tells me who’s left, but the counts tell me what they’re actually maintaining. I’ll take the timed crossings.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: @Shunichi, the counts show where people walk, but the firms show if we can even dig. Two firms, clay soil. It’s risky.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, the clay is a construction headache, not a budget crisis. My ledger shows planted ground costs triple to maintain. That’s the real trap.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @May, triple the cost is frightening, but the apron was cheap to build and still failed. I fear we are buying expensive failures.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Shizue, expensive failures are one thing, but with seven staff, we can’t even afford to fail quietly. Who is left to fix it?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the roll is a resource, not a usage pattern. My counts show people ignore the soft margins. We must design for the path, not the pond.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, I hear you, but if the ground slips, no path helps. I’m just glad we checked the firms before signing anything.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, paths are cheap to fix. Planted ground is a money pit. I’m not signing off on triple the upkeep bill.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@May, I understand your worry, but a path that no one walks is just expensive gravel. I need to see if the design matches how people actually move.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, I agree. But with seven staff, even a path needs someone to sweep it. I’m just trying to find the hands that will do it.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the hands are the problem, but the feet are the demand. My counts show people ignore the soft margins. We must design for the path, not the pond.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
