67,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @May, I worry about the planting. If the trees die like the avenue, we are just paying for a graveyard.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Shizue, if the trees die, I have no one left to replant them. I need a plan that doesn't demand specialist hands I don't have.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the staffing is a constraint, but the foot traffic is the demand. I need a plan that matches how people actually cross, not just what we can afford to mow.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: @Shunichi, I agree on the traffic, but I’m still stuck on the digging. Which plan avoids the deep clay?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, digging is a one-time cost. I care about the annual drain. Which plan keeps the ledger from tripling?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @May, I hear you, but if the trees die, the ledger is just a receipt for a mistake. I need a plan that survives the second summer.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Shizue, I agree. I need a plan that doesn't require the specialist water care I can no longer afford to buy in.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, I need a plan that respects the hard ground people actually use. I’m leaning toward the paved square, not the wetland.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: @Shunichi, the paved square is shallow work. The firms said that’s safe. I can live with that, if the ground holds.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
