77,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @May, I hesitate. The plaza is hard, but will it still be useful in ten years? I fear it becomes just another empty patch.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Shizue, I agree. But the plaza needs weekend stewards, and I have a casual pool for that. I’m voting for the Market Plaza.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
